| `ci_pipeline.steps[].env.<name>` | string | `KEEL_REQUIRED_EXTRAS` is `template,dev,transport,secrets` on `make test`; no other step sets one | an upper-case variable name mapped to its value | `tests/ci_adapters.py`; `tests/integration/test_ci_pipeline_gate.py` | Sets a variable for one step; the GitHub adapter writes it in the step's `env:` map and the GitLab adapter as `NAME=value` before the command, and the gate fails a changed or lost value. | a variable every step needs: `child_env.names` lists what a child may inherit | always |
